### 3. Form1 - Eventi

#### Event A: PlayStateChange (Windows Media Player)
```csharp
axWindowsMediaPlayer.PlayStateChange += axMediaPlayer_PlayStateChange;
```

- **Izvor**: Windows Media Player (zunanja komponenta)
- **Se sproži**: Ko se stanje predvajanja spremeni
- **Handler**: `axMediaPlayer_PlayStateChange(object sender, _WMPOCXEvents_PlayStateChangeEvent e)`
- **Kaj počne handler**: Ko je pesem končana (e.newState == 8), gre na naslednjo

```csharp
private void axMediaPlayer_PlayStateChange(object sender, _WMPOCXEvents_PlayStateChangeEvent e)
{
    if (e.newState == 8)  // Pesem je končana
    {
        this.BeginInvoke(new Action(() => {
            if (lstPlaylist.SelectedIndex != -1)
            {
                buttonNext_Click(null, null);
            }
        }));
    }
}
```

#### Event B: OpenStateChange (Windows Media Player)
```csharp
axWindowsMediaPlayer.OpenStateChange += axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange;
```

- **Izvor**: Windows Media Player (zunanja komponenta)
- **Se sproži**: Ko se datoteka odpre
- **Handler**: `axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange(object sender, _WMPOCXEvents_OpenStateChangeEvent e)`
- **Kaj počne handler**: Izpiše na konzolo, da je datoteka odprta

```csharp
private void axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange(object sender, _WMPOCXEvents_OpenStateChangeEvent e)
{
    if (e.newState == 13)  // Datoteka je odprta
    {
        Console.WriteLine("Datoteka je uspešno odprta");
    }
}
```

