## Naročanja na Eventi (Subscriptions)

### V Form1 konstruktorju:

```csharp
public Form1()
{
    InitializeComponent();

    playlist = new Playlist();
    stats = new PlayerStats();

    // NAROČANJA NA NAŠIH EVENTI
    stats.ItemPlayed += stats_ItemPlayed;
    playlist.PlaylistChanged += playlist_PlaylistChanged;
    playlist.PlaylistError += playlist_PlaylistError;

    // NAROČANJA NA WINDOWS MEDIA PLAYER EVENTI
    axWindowsMediaPlayer.PlayStateChange += axMediaPlayer_PlayStateChange;
    axWindowsMediaPlayer.OpenStateChange += axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange;
}
```

**Skupaj: 5 naročanj**

